WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:08,020
Miss, you want to purchase furniture and buy a wheelchair.

2
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,820
Are you sending it to Pingning Monkey Mansion?

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,620
Miss you are so kind

4
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,580
Not married yet

5
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,300
I am so interested in my future uncle

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,900
You are simply a living Bodhisattva with beautiful people and kind heart.

7
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,940
Stop flattering and keep up.

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,140
Last time I saw her walking with a cane

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,060
Looks tired

10
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,660
Emotions are all cultivated

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,740
I can't just paint someone's face

12
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,980
Just leave the other side alone.

13
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,980
Give a wheelchair for more use

14
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,420
This is called early investment

15
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,500
It’s faster to build a wheelchair according to this drawing

16
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,860
Delivered to Pingning Monkey Mansion

17
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:41,350
Okay girl

18
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:43,430
Do you know if the deposit is non-refundable?

19
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,480
That miserable piece of Ping Ning Monkey

20
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,200
He will smash whatever you give him.

21
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,400
Send this rag to a commission

22
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,680
Earn a certain amount of money for free
